                                "sense_id": "169a62d0-44fe-3ec5-90bf-97e0c4f89893",
                                "text": "It seems likely that parents are free to respond in these different ways because they have no fear of their child growing into a chronic, adult knee-grazer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18609fa7-b0b0-3ed7-ad3c-552402151ecf",
